  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Our Cargo shoulder bag is the one you stop thinking about and start relying on. Crafted in smooth leather with polished argento hardware, it has a zip closure that keeps things secure and exterior pockets for quick access on the move. The adjustable drop means it sits comfortably where you want it. Quietly indispensable.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Smooth leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> KS matte lining</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Adjustable shoulder strap with 10&quot; drop at center hole</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior 1 zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip top closure</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Argento hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 12&quot; (L) x 7.4&quot; (H) x 5.31&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
